</div>
<br />
Hi everyone, I would like to give a special thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(776854); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=776854&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592063914" alt="Tanhony" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=776854)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(776854); return false;">Tanhony</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5255688); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592063914" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5255688); return false;">DrAkimoto</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5596963); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5596963&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592063914" alt="Dr Moned" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5596963)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5596963); return false;">Dr Moned</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darnelljermaine" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2756997); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2756997&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592063914" alt="DarnellJermaine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2756997)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darnelljermaine" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2756997); return false;">DarnellJermaine</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meska" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1322433); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1322433&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592063914" alt="Meska" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1322433)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meska" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1322433); return false;">Meska</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6030962); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1592063914" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6030962); return false;">Veralta</a></span> for their help in critiquing the drafts of this article.
<hr />
<div style="text-align: center;">
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">◎&nbsp;Spoilers&nbsp;◎</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">◉&nbsp;Close&nbsp;◉</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content"></div>
<br />
<div style="text-align: left;">
<p>Okay, so after reading this — you may be a bit confused. So first off, the thing in the corner of the room is the dead body of a reality-bender; the boy in the window — to be exact and the &quot;metallic objects&quot; are nails. The reason they died was that his parents were deeply religious and in them not understanding their son's anomalous properties, they believed him to be demonically possessed and as stuff like exorcisms didn't work, they resorted to killing him to free his spirit in a way.</p>
<p>All of the weird things in the room are the process of the boy being killed with poison, weapons, and religious objects. PoI-5256 was a friend of the boy who witnessed the murder in the last time she saw him. With the boy not wanting the girl to have to live with the knowledge, he gave himself an anti-memetic filter to remove all knowledge of him. The term &quot;impurities&quot; refers to what they call anomalies in general.</p>
<p>With all of this weird stuff happening, the parents fled and are currently being searched for by the Foundation.<br /></p>
<div style="text-align: center;"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
