														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4687078">
									

<p>I am terrible at solving mysteries, puzzles, etc so I looked at the spoiler. Good article though, I enjoyed reading it. +1 from me.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">some&nbsp;nitpicks</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">whoosh</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>Due to the lack of knowledge regarding SCP-5256's true nature, entry to the anomaly is limited — only being permissible per a formal request to the current acting research head of SCP-5256.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Stylistic choice maybe, but the em dash isn't necessary here. Put a comma instead, like this:</p>
<p><em>Due to the lack of knowledge regarding SCP-5256's true nature, entry to the anomaly is limited, and it is only permissible per a formal request to the current acting research head of SCP-5256.</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Only a single book pertaining to ceasing witchcraft and exorcisms <strong>being deemed</strong> of any interest.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Weird wording here. maybe this will fix:</p>
<p><em>Only a single book pertaining to &quot;ceasing witchcraft&quot; and exorcisms deemed interest.</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>This mixture along with stomach acid is also present in small amounts within the air inside SCP-5256.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Needs some commas, also there's too many preposition phrases in a row:</p>
<p><em>This mixture, alone with stomach acid, is present in small amounts in SCP-5256's atmosphere.</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>A wooden crucifix along with stakes made of the same material.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Along what though? the wall? And just saying &quot;same material&quot; doesn't mean the reader will assume it's the Aconite mixture. Fix:</p>
<p><em>A wooden crucifix with stakes made of the Aconite mixture.</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>A plastic syringe <strong>containing</strong> medical-grade anesthetics <strong>containing</strong> trace amounts of neural tissue which possessed low Hume levels.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Word choice fix:</p>
<p><em>A plastic syringe containing medical-grade anesthetics with trace amounts of neural tissue, which registered low Hume levels.</em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

